// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL3_Vahzilok_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3703841415" "Every time the Vahzilok population increases, so does the disease rate. The hospital wards are filling up, {HeroName}, and something has to be done. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to hit the streets and cull the numbers of the Vahzilok.</A> Maybe that will get the city back on the mend."
// AcceptString :
"P2803580391" "Hit the streets and cull the numbers of the Vahzilok"
// SendOffString :
"P2102289158" "There are Vahzilok all over Faultline and Steel Canyon. I'd like you to start in those areas."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3356776666" "Stop wave of illnesses"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2882124038" "The hospital wards are still standing room only. If you can't defeat a few more Vahzilok, Paragon City may never be healthy again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3905670225" "You have decreased the number of illnesses propagated by the Vahzilok."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P771082682" "You did a good job dealing with those Vahzilok, {HeroName}. Thanks to you, the hospitals are clearing out."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL3_Vahzilok_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1024357390" "The neighborhood watch in Steel Canyon is reporting an increase in Vahzilok kidnappings. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Someone has to stop the Vahzilok from making off with Steel Canyon citizens!</A> I need you over there, on the double!"
// AcceptString :
"P2211344612" "Stop the Vahzilok from making off with Steel Canyon citizens"
// SendOffString :
"P1873155665" "There have been recent incidents in Gimry Ridge and The Copper District. I recommend starting near those neighborhoods."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P847204339" "Combat Vahzilok in Steel Canyon"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1052801836" "I need you to make a bigger impression on the Vahzilok. I want those kidnappings stopped!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P452946942" "You have discouraged the Vahzilok from kidnapping the people of Steel Canyon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2988643181" "It is every hero's job to keep our citizens safe from the Vahzilok. They are an enemy without mercy or regret."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL3_Vahzilok_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P984081156" "I've learned that the Vahzilok have been raiding the labs and medical centers in Faultline. In the last raid, they took a number of organs that were intended for transplants. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to get over to Faultline and stop the Vahzilok raids.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P571948606" "Go to Faultline and stop the Vahzilok raids"
// SendOffString :
"P480250258" "A lot of the raids have taken place in New Overbrook.<br><br>The Vahzilok have been spoted in and around the underpass in that neighborhood.</color><br><br>Start looking for Vahzilok around there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P158889337" "Combat Vahzilok in Faultline"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2764837304" "{HeroName}, those Vahzilok raids have to stop!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3752774127" "You have discouraged the Vahzilok from raiding Faultline's medical centers for human organs."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4221517229" "Thanks for putting down those Vahzilok raids, {HeroName}. I'm sure Paragon City's medical community is as grateful as I."

