"P1424911521" "You failed to stop the Vahzilok from translating the Tome of {ITEM_NAME}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1831661933" "'I've heard that the eidolons retain working brains and all the memories of their human lives. I guess the memory of being beautiful must have tortured {PERSON_NAME}. So she decided to regain her lost looks by performing one of the rituals described in the Tome of {ITEM_NAME}.<br><br>It's sad, really. How could anyone trade her life, however short, for a hollow existence as one of Vahzilok's zombies?"
// RandomFameString :
"P2945849152" "I wonder if {HeroName} was wise enough not to read from the Tome of {ITEM_NAME}?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2933491994" "So the Vahzilok still have the Tome of {ITEM_NAME}. I know you did your best, but this failure could really cost us."
